# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (common on Windows) checks files out with
# CRLF, which makes oxfmt (`vp fmt` / `vp check`) report every file as
# unformatted. Pinning `eol=lf` keeps the working tree consistent with what the
# formatter enforces on all platforms and in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
